  "method": "Read every deployment implementation module and both deployment runbooks in the frozen group, then traced initialization, release/provider/config-layer/HTTPS/control/service lifecycle transitions, partial publication, terminal-record failure and old/candidate recovery. Checked stop evidence, persistent start barriers, exact active/enabled restoration, root/native ownership, scoped filesystem/Git helpers and the separate config-check unit against real systemd semantics. Parsed every Python deployment test file into AST, inspected every named test, assertion, fault injection and platform gate, reviewed process/network/destructive fixture calls, and read the critical native/process/runbook fixtures directly. Read all tooling JavaScript, workflows, tooling tests and remaining docs. Parsed all 20 feature-evidence JSON files; inspected their result/limitation boundaries and all 178 capability method mappings, 50 evidence groups and 15 additional workflows, validating referenced hashes without treating historical point-in-time evidence as current acceptance. Structurally inspected the entire lockfile: 336 integrity-pinned packages, 336 snapshots, 623 closed dependency edges, direct importer/package agreement and no external/path resolutions. No old implementation, old Git objects, personal credentials, model/provider business calls, remote service mutations or test suites were used. Final node scripts/snapshot.mjs returned the original 1876-file digest.",
